    idm: ['Brown to yellowish-brown on top, white or light gray underneath ^1,2', 'Rounded disc corners; disc about as wide as long, with a pointed snout that sticks out ^1,2', 'Long whip-like tail with a venomous spine near the base ^1,2', 'One of the smaller rays in its family ^2'],
    sz: 'Wingspan up to about 2 ft. Lagoon fish in Florida reached roughly 13 in (males) and 15 in (females) across the disc. ^1,2',
